{"4861680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Check Twice", "steam_appid": 4861680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHECK TWICE: THE NEW ANOMALY HUNTER SET IN AN OFFICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it through all the floors and escape alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/e9a44e161a6aff5806e86d73c648120b.poster.avif?t=1788313012\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/e9a44e161a6aff5806e86d73c648120b.webm?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/e9a44e161a6aff5806e86d73c648120b.mp4?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim is to memorise the original state of the floor and spot discrepancies generated at random on lower levels; these may be minor changes or major ones. To win, you must escape the office complex by passing through a number of floors, checking on each one whether an anomaly has occurred or if the room is clear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One office, thousands of details.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast floor plan with a wealth of details. Can you memorise them all and rise to the challenge? Will you find all the anomalies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/fceca63d4e4e1a652815398478023f2d.poster.avif?t=1788313012\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/fceca63d4e4e1a652815398478023f2d.webm?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/fceca63d4e4e1a652815398478023f2d.mp4?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The lifts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor is a decision. Choose the right lift to continue descending floor by floor, but be careful: one wrong choice will send you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/99ef71b04f5d09918b10182604501f3d.poster.avif?t=1788313012\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/99ef71b04f5d09918b10182604501f3d.webm?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/99ef71b04f5d09918b10182604501f3d.mp4?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHECK TWICE: THE NEW ANOMALY HUNTER SET IN AN OFFICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it through all the floors and escape alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/e9a44e161a6aff5806e86d73c648120b.poster.avif?t=1788313012\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/e9a44e161a6aff5806e86d73c648120b.webm?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/e9a44e161a6aff5806e86d73c648120b.mp4?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim is to memorise the original state of the floor and spot discrepancies generated at random on lower levels; these may be minor changes or major ones. To win, you must escape the office complex by passing through a number of floors, checking on each one whether an anomaly has occurred or if the room is clear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One office, thousands of details.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast floor plan with a wealth of details. Can you memorise them all and rise to the challenge? Will you find all the anomalies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/fceca63d4e4e1a652815398478023f2d.poster.avif?t=1788313012\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/fceca63d4e4e1a652815398478023f2d.webm?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861680/extras/fceca63d4e4e1a652815398478023f2d.mp4?t=1788313012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The lifts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor is a decision. Choose the right lift to continue descending floor by floor, but be careful: one wrong choice will send you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl